{"suttaId":"tha-ap309","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[9156,9177],"vripara":"32"},"segments":{"tha-ap309:0.3":"Ārāmadāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap309:1.1":"“Siddhatthassa bhagavato, ārāmo ropito mayā;","tha-ap309:1.3":"Sandacchāyesu [sītachāyesu (syā.), santacchāyesu (ka.)] rukkhesu, upāsantesu pakkhisu.","tha-ap309:2.1":"“Addasaṃ virajaṃ buddhaṃ, āhutīnaṃ paṭiggahaṃ;","tha-ap309:2.3":"Ārāmaṃ abhināmesiṃ, lokajeṭṭhaṃ narāsabhaṃ.","tha-ap309:3.1":"“Haṭṭho haṭṭhena cittena, phalaṃ pupphamadāsahaṃ;","tha-ap309:3.3":"Tato jātappasādova, taṃ vanaṃ pariṇāmayiṃ.","tha-ap309:4.1":"“Buddhassa yamidaṃ dāsiṃ, vippasannena cetasā;","tha-ap309:4.3":"Bhave nibbattamānamhi, nibbattati phalaṃ mama.","tha-ap309:5.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ ārāmamadaṃ tadā;","tha-ap309:5.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, ārāmassa idaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap309:6.1":"“Sattatiṃse ito kappe, sattāsuṃ mudusītalā;","tha-ap309:6.3":"Sattaratanasampannā, cakkavattī mahabbalā.","tha-ap309:7.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap309:8.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ārāmadāyako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap309:9.1":"Ārāmadāyakattherassāpadānaṃ sattamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
